koz Benchmark : arithmetic. A tree of 16 384 leaves, each one computes a long expression of its parameter finkoz

zafer feuille(x)
ouver
    ran (x fwa x èk x mwin 1) fwa 3 koup (x èk 2) mwin x fwa 2 èk 7
fèrm

zafer arbre(n, x)
ouver
    kan n piti 1 ouver ran feuille(x) fèrm
    ran arbre(n mwin 1, x) èk arbre(n mwin 1, x èk 1)
fèrm

afise(arbre(14, 1))
